: "Bug 1661673 - switch cron-bouncer to esr78. r=releng-reviewers,aki a=release DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D88619", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/cron-bouncer-check/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7fd61f43f6dc7108d9c7025824b6cd8389ab533a", "parents": ["a224a890b3414d97969ff8bbb5e54d6a156b8636"], "tags": []}], "date": 1600893081, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mtabara@mozilla.com"}, "81": {"changesets": [{"author": "Zhao Jiazhong \u003czhaojiazhong-hf@loongson.cn\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1649655 - [MIPS] Add CodeGenerator::visitWasmRegisterResult function. r=lth, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D81804", "files": ["js/src/jit/mips-shared/CodeGenerator-mips-shared.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "baf8a8d379dc100599e1a5bbe15fe53b09164d35", "parents": ["7fd61f43f6dc7108d9c7025824b6cd8389ab533a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr78 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91304", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "723b7c8d77ea32759f12081d7f2caaadea6ff3c2", "parents": ["baf8a8d379dc100599e1a5bbe15fe53b09164d35"], "tags": []}], "date": 1600971012, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "82": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ted Campbell \u003ctcampbell@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1642332 - Avoid static initializer for Number.NaN. r=jandem, a=RyanVM\n\nThis also fixes correctness issue on MIPS platform.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D77673", "files": ["js/src/jsnum.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a6c226548fa02c3ac4681499103cd85217c6de07", "parents": ["723b7c8d77ea32759f12081d7f2caaadea6ff3c2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1660901 - Support the fstat-like subset of fstatat in the Linux sandbox policies. r=gcp, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D88499", "files": ["security/sandbox/linux/SandboxFilter.cpp", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerUtils.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a65fc6aca1f2337cb5e8e69f50b539d3c0de95ab", "parents": ["a6c226548fa02c3ac4681499103cd85217c6de07"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1660901 - Add some test cases for fstatat inside the content sandbox. r=gcp, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D88500", "files": ["security/sandbox/common/test/SandboxTestingChild.cpp", "security/sandbox/common/test/SandboxTestingChild.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0ce38d3c2aa2357df4a8fcc5fd39d3af05fce7e1", "parents": ["a65fc6aca1f2337cb5e8e69f50b539d3c0de95ab"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1660901 - ignore AT_NO_AUTOMOUNT in fstatat system call. r=jld, a=RyanVM\n\nPer the manpage \"Both stat() and lstat() act as though AT_NO_AUTOMOUNT\nwas set.\", so don't bail if it's set in a call to fstatat.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D89121", "files": ["security/sandbox/linux/SandboxFilter.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8ecb82a2f65cf6082d50d1e00453fbeba97633fb", "parents": ["0ce38d3c2aa2357df4a8fcc5fd39d3af05fce7e1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1666646 - Set CodeAlignment to 16 for the 'none' backend. r=jonco, a=RyanVM\n\nThis fixes a static_assert on 32-bit platforms because 4 is too small for the JitCode\ncell header alignment.\n\nThe CodeAlignment value does't really matter as the none backend does not allocate\nany JIT code or JitCode instances, but 16 matches x86 and x64.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91093", "files": ["js/src/jit/none/MacroAssembler-none.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5fa4919bc4d846abbd7b9bc6cb233ac992be7b75", "parents": ["8ecb82a2f65cf6082d50d1e00453fbeba97633fb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1664252 - Stop breaking redirect chains when expiring visits for long urls. r=adw, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D89924", "files": ["toolkit/components/places/PlacesExpiration.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d00c6fc37bc6b6abb565e8a4f218436b90899154", "parents": ["5fa4919bc4d846abbd7b9bc6cb233ac992be7b75"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1658259 - Ignore OfferToSaveLoginsDefault if OfferToSaveLogins is present. r=emalysz, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D88664", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.jsm", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_bug1658259.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "311947201cf5577344fd9da1bc81c4ec9977daf5", "parents": ["d00c6fc37bc6b6abb565e8a4f218436b90899154"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1656697. r=valentin, a=RyanVM\n\nThe root cause in this bug is that the connection info used by `SpdyConnectTransaction` is the same instance as the connection info in `nsHttpTransaction`, so we should clone it and let `SpdyConnectTransaction` use the cloned one.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D89801", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/Http2Session.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpTransaction.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "005391f69f10fd4a2afa986565b39ef12f908632", "parents": ["311947201cf5577344fd9da1bc81c4ec9977daf5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1663642 - fix. r=kershaw a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90070", "files": ["netwerk/base/nsStandardURL.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "be9479262e1659ebc567d7574c1651e2533b2dbe", "parents": ["005391f69f10fd4a2afa986565b39ef12f908632"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1663439 - Avoid negative avail bsizes in paginated table reflow. r=TYLin, a=tjr\n\nThis causes an assertion when printing the test-case, though it turns\nout not to be the cause of the bug in the end. Still seems worth fixing,\nand will be tested by the test in the following patch.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90145", "files": ["layout/tables/nsTableFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5f6e1d52b74bec4288384e2877d03210a9ca18db", "parents": ["be9479262e1659ebc567d7574c1651e2533b2dbe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1663439 - Re-order rowgroups if reflowing a tfoot with an already split next-in-flow. r=TYLin, a=tjr\n\nAs the reflow may destroy the next-in-flow. See existing code.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90146", "files": ["layout/tables/nsTableFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a52f892e91568c6fb899b7f2ff63d2c7d08810de", "parents": ["5f6e1d52b74bec4288384e2877d03210a9ca18db"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601058067, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "83": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1660901 - Fix debug nsCString bustage. a=bustage", "files": ["security/sandbox/common/test/SandboxTestingChild.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3b5f35d0398f6a72aaa12f2efcd47e0b353872a7", "parents": ["a52f892e91568c6fb899b7f2ff63d2c7d08810de"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601064306, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "84": {"changesets": [{"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chikezoe.birchill@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1641733 - Trigger print via FrameLoader.print in the parant process instead of in the content process. r=jwatt, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D78214", "files": ["layout/tools/reftest/reftest-content.js", "layout/tools/reftest/reftest.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4b46f86f5cfdb539044969fae6b6356934a26794", "parents": ["3b5f35d0398f6a72aaa12f2efcd47e0b353872a7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1664728 - Addref Telemetry instance before dropping the lock. r=janerik, a=jcristau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90468", "files": ["toolkit/components/telemetry/core/Telemetry.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5abdd17b3c5650a91780b8e50607982266af99c0", "parents": ["4b46f86f5cfdb539044969fae6b6356934a26794"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maja Frydrychowicz \u003cmjzffr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1582736 - Open new tab per navigation when testing acceptInsecureCerts. r=jgraham, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90704", "files": ["testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/unit/test_navigation.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "eaed3647025cf1f48228df545d78590c67f3635e", "parents": ["5abdd17b3c5650a91780b8e50607982266af99c0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601080005, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "85": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out changeset eaed3647025c (bug 1582736) for TestTLSNavigation failures.", "files": ["testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/unit/test_navigation.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2ae7761ced3111cac22d9c1986e5dd100adebb04", "parents": ["eaed3647025cf1f48228df545d78590c67f3635e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601083144, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "86": {"changesets": [{"author": "Henrik Skupin \u003cmail@hskupin.info\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1582736 - [marionette] Navigation tests of TestTLSNavigation needs to run in their own tab. r=maja_zf, a=test-only\n\nBecause TestTLSNavigation is not based off BaseNavigationTestCase\neach of its tests is run inside the initial tab. This could cause\nbad interactions between tests and should be avoided.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90466", "files": ["testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/unit/test_navigation.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "41481b07c94866aa43ab5c86d99c38ff82962974", "parents": ["2ae7761ced3111cac22d9c1986e5dd100adebb04"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maja Frydrychowicz \u003cmjzffr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1582736 - Open new tab per navigation when testing acceptInsecureCerts. r=jgraham, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90704", "files": ["testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/unit/test_navigation.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5d00e1e83efb85333f294741cdf3bb0a797d7c80", "parents": ["41481b07c94866aa43ab5c86d99c38ff82962974"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr78 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91596", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "66dea854695ec6e58f1ccbc72f101d02d6250f8f", "parents": ["5d00e1e83efb85333f294741cdf3bb0a797d7c80"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jean-Yves Avenard \u003cjyavenard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1663227 - Always process decoded video promise to avoid leaks. r=mattwoodrow, a=RyanVM\n\nThis is a quick & dirty solution designed for easy uplift to beta.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D90203", "files": ["dom/media/ipc/RemoteDecoderChild.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d8914a146bac9e815b94f60db6d237d588cb8a12", "parents": ["66dea854695ec6e58f1ccbc72f101d02d6250f8f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1666249 - Save canonical name when lookup with DNS-over-HTTPS enabled. r=kershaw, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91466", "files": ["netwerk/dns/TRR.cpp", "netwerk/test/unit/head_trr.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_trr_case_sensitivity.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2e49fc7ae610a364ff998fd3cd313f8eb1f6707b", "parents": ["d8914a146bac9e815b94f60db6d237d588cb8a12"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601312411, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "87": {"changesets": [{"author": "Joel Maher \u003cjmaher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1665473 -[ESR78] use existing EDID mac minis. r=bc, a=release\n\n[ESR78] use existing EDID mac minis (rebase for ESR78)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91628", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/condprof/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/config.yml", "taskcluster/ci/iris/kind.yml", "taskcluster/ci/source-test/python.yml", "taskcluster/ci/webrender/kind.yml", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/mach.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/job/run_task.py", "taskcluster/taskgraph/transforms/tests.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f29cd271751961722a3a1863b517982babfac60e", "parents": ["2e49fc7ae610a364ff998fd3cd313f8eb1f6707b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601382720, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "jcristau@mozilla.com"}, "88": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_78_3_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bump version to 78.3.1. DONTBUILD a=release", "files": ["browser/config/version.txt", "browser/config/version_display.txt", "config/milestone.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d250557c2ea286a6f2f2cac996541c5de020d2a9", "parents": ["fc94a8dbf2e71656c6e2bcfa72b7c9edef98ef7b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1601390693, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "89": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dan Minor \u003cdminor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1666570 - Cherrypick ffed0925f27d404173c1e3e750d818f432d2c019 from usrsctp; r=drno, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91047", "files": ["netwerk/sctp/src/netinet/sctp_indata.c"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c114d8537287f1eac3b45c75806928887bf4ceb4", "parents": ["f29cd271751961722a3a1863b517982babfac60e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Joel Maher \u003cjmaher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1667853 - Turn off socket process tests on ESR78. r+a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91631", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/test/mochitest.yml", "taskcluster/ci/test/xpcshell.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c53880d85184206bd005675fae28e1fe040182e9", "parents": ["c114d8537287f1eac3b45c75806928887bf4ceb4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Miko Mynttinen \u003cmikokm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1627616 - Avoid wrapping SourceSurfaceOffset around uninitialized SourceSurface. r=bas, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D86745", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetD2D1.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetOffset.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ae6ad218f89fc3ea85c4661dad617bd942f01637", "parents": ["c53880d85184206bd005675fae28e1fe040182e9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Miko Mynttinen \u003cmikokm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1662484 - Do not allow wrapping SourceSurfaceOffset around null surfaces. r=mstange, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D89006", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetOffset.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetOffset.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "70dbf5235e62bcf58be8d2fd38ecd96b6a698c13", "parents": ["ae6ad218f89fc3ea85c4661dad617bd942f01637"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Simon Giesecke \u003csgiesecke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1648010 - Add user-defined string literals. r=froydnj, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D81125", "files": ["xpcom/string/nsLiteralString.h", "xpcom/string/nsTLiteralString.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c9bca8151896df9a8a27cba646f63da3ca879ae3", "parents": ["70dbf5235e62bcf58be8d2fd38ecd96b6a698c13"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1666836 - Set bools correct with legacy preferences. r=emalysz, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D91178", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.jsm"